          <li><a href="#kainchi-dham-connectivity" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Visiting Kainchi Dham: The Quiet 18-Kilometre Corridor</a></li>
          <li><a href="#itinerary" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">An Unhurried 3-Day Rhythm: Temples, Valleys & Starlit Nights</a></li>
          <li><a href="#exploring-mukteshwar" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Beyond the Town: Hidden Waterfalls & Ancient Cliffs</a></li>
