          <li><a href="#accommodations" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Where You’ll Sleep: Waking Up to Snow Peaks from Bed</a></li>
          <li><a href="#workation-connectivity" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Working from the Hills: 150 Mbps Fiber & Pine Breeze</a></li>
          <li><a href="#dining" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Gathering for Dinner: Kumaoni Flavours & Mountain Greens</a></li>
          <li><a href="#pet-friendly" class="hover:text-[#c9a832] transition-colors">Open Space to Breathe: 2,200 Sq. Ft. Enclosed Lawns</a></li>
